#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Preservation and moderation events are hash-chained, so editing history "
"after the fact changes the archive chain head. Anyone who previously "
"noted the head published on {when} can confirm it only moved forward:"
msgstr ""
"Los eventos de preservación y moderación están encadenados por hash, de "
"modo que editar el historial a posteriori cambia la cabeza de cadena del "
"acervo. Quien haya anotado antes la cabeza publicada el {when} puede "
"confirmar que solo ha avanzado:"

msgid ""
"Preservation and moderation events are hash-chained, so editing history "
"after the fact changes the archive chain head. This archive has not "
"published an attestation yet, so there is no chain head here to note — "
"the value is not computed live for visitors, because a per-request value "
